    "name": "Date or Destiny : Kiss or Miss",
    "steam_appid": 2127030,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Step beyond an ordinary love story with <strong>&quot;Date or Destiny: Kiss or Miss.&quot;</strong> Take control of Kaan, a young man kicked out by his father, drifting through life with no purpose. In a city full of strangers and surprises, it\u2019s up to you to shape his fate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2127030/extras/46da6f539508a527c989a6538eea58fd.avif?t=1751035600\" data-has-big /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Meet new people. Choose your words wisely. Decide who to trust, who to walk away from, and whether to follow your heart or your head. Every choice leads to a different consequence, every moment a turning point.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fall in love, face heartbreak, uncover secrets. Take risks, make bold moves, and guide Kaan through a journey that could end in passion, regret, or something completely unexpected.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2127030/extras/cd23dbf11f1d78b6b94a9739d0689a08.avif?t=1751035600\" data-has-big /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Don\u2019t just watch\u2014live the story. Real video scenes, emotional twists, and branching paths put you in the heart of the experience. Make your choices, face their consequences, and see how far you're willing to go.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Will you find love, or let it slip away? The choice is yours.<br>Kaan\u2019s destiny is in your hands.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Step beyond an ordinary love story with <strong>&quot;Date or Destiny: Kiss or Miss.&quot;</strong> Take control of Kaan, a young man kicked out by his father, drifting through life with no purpose. In a city full of strangers and surprises, it\u2019s up to you to shape his fate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2127030/extras/46da6f539508a527c989a6538eea58fd.avif?t=1751035600\" data-has-big /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Meet new people. Choose your words wisely. Decide who to trust, who to walk away from, and whether to follow your heart or your head. Every choice leads to a different consequence, every moment a turning point.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fall in love, face heartbreak, uncover secrets. Take risks, make bold moves, and guide Kaan through a journey that could end in passion, regret, or something completely unexpected.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2127030/extras/cd23dbf11f1d78b6b94a9739d0689a08.avif?t=1751035600\" data-has-big /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Don\u2019t just watch\u2014live the story. Real video scenes, emotional twists, and branching paths put you in the heart of the experience. Make your choices, face their consequences, and see how far you're willing to go.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Will you find love, or let it slip away? The choice is yours.<br>Kaan\u2019s destiny is in your hands.</p>",
    "short_description": "In Date or Destiny: Kiss or Miss, guide Kaan through his love-filled adventure. Meet different girls, make your choices, and shape the course of the story. The right decisions may lead you to a happy ending, but every wrong step brings you closer to a bitter fate.",
